        ("p", T(
            "**{{KeLBrush}} > {{KeLCSG}}**: **{{KeLCSGSubtract}}** (<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>) cuts the selected brushes out of everything they touch, **{{KeLCSGMerge}}** joins brushes into one convex brush, **{{KeLCSGWrapMerge}}** (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>) wraps them in one, **{{KeLCSGIntersect}}** (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>) keeps only the common part, **{{KeLMakeRoom}}** turns a brush into a hollow room. **{{KeLMakeDetail}}** (<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd>) and **{{KeLMakeStructural}}** (<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>) set the detail flag.",
            "**{{KeLBrush}} > {{KeLCSG}}**: **{{KeLCSGSubtract}}** (<kbd>Umschalt</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>) schneidet die gewählten Brushes aus allem heraus, was sie berühren, **{{KeLCSGMerge}}** vereint Brushes zu einem konvexen Brush, **{{KeLCSGWrapMerge}}** (<kbd>Strg</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>) hüllt sie in einen, **{{KeLCSGIntersect}}** (<kbd>Strg</kbd>+<kbd>Umschalt</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>) behält nur den gemeinsamen Teil, **{{KeLMakeRoom}}** macht aus einem Brush einen hohlen Raum. **{{KeLMakeDetail}}** (<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd>) und **{{KeLMakeStructural}}** (<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>) setzen das Detail-Kennzeichen.",
            "**{{KeLBrush}} > {{KeLCSG}}**:**{{KeLCSGSubtract}}**(<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>)把选中的笔刷从所有与之接触的笔刷中挖掉,**{{KeLCSGMerge}}** 把笔刷合并成一个凸笔刷,**{{KeLCSGWrapMerge}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>)把它们包成一个,**{{KeLCSGIntersect}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>)只保留共同部分,**{{KeLMakeRoom}}** 把笔刷变成空心房间。**{{KeLMakeDetail}}**(<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd>)和 **{{KeLMakeStructural}}**(<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>)设置细节标志。",
            "**{{KeLBrush}} > {{KeLCSG}}**:**{{KeLCSGSubtract}}**(<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>)は選択したブラシを、触れているものすべてから切り抜きます。**{{KeLCSGMerge}}** はブラシを 1 つの凸ブラシにまとめ、**{{KeLCSGWrapMerge}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>)は 1 つで包み、**{{KeLCSGIntersect}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>)は共通部分だけを残し、**{{KeLMakeRoom}}** はブラシを中空の部屋にします。**{{KeLMakeDetail}}**(<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd>)と **{{KeLMakeStructural}}**(<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>)はディテールのフラグを設定します。")),
        ("h2", "formen", T("Brush shapes and transformations", "Brush-Formen und Transformationen", "笔刷形状和变换", "ブラシの形と変形")),
        ("img", "h_karteneditor_seiten", T("The number of sides for **{{KeLPrism}}**.", "Die Zahl der Seiten für **{{KeLPrism}}**.", "**{{KeLPrism}}** 的边数。", "**{{KeLPrism}}** の辺の数。")),
        ("p", T(
            "**{{KeLBrush}}** turns the selected brush into a **{{KeLPrism}}**, **{{KeLCone}}**, **{{KeLSphere}}**, **{{KeLRock}}** or **{{KeLIcosahedron}}**; a small dialog asks for the number of sides. <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>3</kbd> ... <kbd>9</kbd> make a prism with that many sides around the axis of the active 2D view. **{{KeLModify}}** rotates and mirrors the selection around its centre, **{{KeLArbitraryRotation}}** (<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>) and **{{KeLArbitraryScale}}** (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>) take exact values. **{{KeLRepeatTransforms}}** (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>) repeats the last move, rotation or scale, **{{KeLResetTransforms}}** (<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>) forgets it.",
            "**{{KeLBrush}}** macht aus dem gewählten Brush ein **{{KeLPrism}}**, einen **{{KeLCone}}**, eine **{{KeLSphere}}**, einen **{{KeLRock}}** oder ein **{{KeLIcosahedron}}**; ein kleiner Dialog fragt nach der Zahl der Seiten. <kbd>Strg</kbd>+<kbd>3</kbd> ... <kbd>9</kbd> machen ein Prisma mit so vielen Seiten um die Achse der aktiven 2D-Ansicht. **{{KeLModify}}** dreht und spiegelt die Auswahl um ihre Mitte, **{{KeLArbitraryRotation}}** (<kbd>Umschalt</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>) und **{{KeLArbitraryScale}}** (<kbd>Strg</kbd>+<kbd>Umschalt</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>) nehmen genaue Werte. **{{KeLRepeatTransforms}}** (<kbd>Strg</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>) wiederholt das letzte Verschieben, Drehen oder Skalieren, **{{KeLResetTransforms}}** (<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>) vergisst es.",
            "**{{KeLBrush}}** 把选中的笔刷变成 **{{KeLPrism}}**、**{{KeLCone}}**、**{{KeLSphere}}**、**{{KeLRock}}** 或 **{{KeLIcosahedron}}**;一个小对话框会询问边数。<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>3</kbd> ... <kbd>9</kbd> 围绕当前二维视图的轴生成相应边数的棱柱。**{{KeLModify}}** 围绕选中对象的中心旋转和镜像,**{{KeLArbitraryRotation}}**(<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>)和 **{{KeLArbitraryScale}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>)可输入精确数值。**{{KeLRepeatTransforms}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>)重复上一次移动、旋转或缩放,**{{KeLResetTransforms}}**(<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>)清除它。",
            "**{{KeLBrush}}** は選択したブラシを **{{KeLPrism}}**、**{{KeLCone}}**、**{{KeLSphere}}**、**{{KeLRock}}**、**{{KeLIcosahedron}}** にします。小さなダイアログで辺の数を聞きます。<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>3</kbd>〜<kbd>9</kbd> は、アクティブな 2D ビューの軸の周りにその数の辺を持つ角柱を作ります。**{{KeLModify}}** は選択範囲をその中心で回転・反転し、**{{KeLArbitraryRotation}}**(<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>)と **{{KeLArbitraryScale}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd>)は正確な値を入力できます。**{{KeLRepeatTransforms}}**(<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>)は直前の移動・回転・拡大縮小を繰り返し、**{{KeLResetTransforms}}**(<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>R</kbd>)はそれを忘れます。")),
